@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8080
@email = demo@example.com

### Contraseña incorrecta · 401 invalid_credentials
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "wrong-password-for-this-test"
}

### Falta la contraseña · 400 invalid_request
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}"
}

### Perfil sin token · 401 invalid_session
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/auth/me

### Logout con token inválido · 401 invalid_session
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer invalid-token
